 ey\; USD 3\,000 stipend)
DESCRIPTION:Kala's long-running Media Arts Fellowship supports four artists
  working in film and video\, sound\, animation\, performance cinema and me
 dia installation. ELIGIBILITY: local\, national and international artists 
 not enrolled in a degree programme. OFFER: USD 3\,000 stipend and up to ni
 ne months of unlimited access to Kala's media lab and facilities.\n\nOrgan
 isation: Kala Art Institute\nLocation: Berkeley\, California\, USA. On sit
 e.\nAward: USD 3\,000 stipend plus facility access.\nDuration: Up to 9 mon
 ths of facility access\n\nMore: https://www.kala.org/residencies/kalas-med
 ia-arts-artist-residence-exhibition-award/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugra
 ntdesk&utm_medium=referral
