SUMMARY:Deadline: Generator Residency (Kairos x Constellation\, Winter 2027
 )
DESCRIPTION:A three-month residency for AI safety generalists: builders\, o
 perators and organizers rather than researchers. Residents pitch\, build a
 nd ship their own projects with weekly advice from field leaders\, then ge
 t support landing a full-time AI safety role.\n\nOrganisation: Kairos and 
 Constellation\nLocation: Berkeley\, California\, USA (Constellation office
 ). Core residency is in person\; J-1 visa sponsorship available for most i
 nternational applicants.\nAward: USD 8\,500 per month stipend (some Embedd
 ed track residents employed at a roughly equivalent salary)\, plus travel 
 to and from Berkeley. No application fee.\nDuration: 3 months full-time (1
 8 January to 9 April 2027)\; selected residents can extend in person until
  late May and remotely until early July 2027.\n\nMore: https://generatorre
 sidency.org/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://generatorresidency.org/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&u
 tm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Berkeley\, California\, USA (Constellation office). Core residency
  is in person\; J-1 visa sponsorship available for most international appl
 icants.
END:VEVENT
